{"2978850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eden Warrior", "steam_appid": 2978850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face boss after boss in stylish, adrenaline-fueled combat.</strong><br>Slash, dodge, and strike with precision in a pure-action experience where every move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark fantasy narrative:</strong><br>You are a puppet - forged to hunt the corrupted legends of a fallen empire.<br>Unsheathe your sword and beat the evil out of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious figure guides you through ruined lands, revealing the truth behind your enemies... and yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn. Brutal to master.</strong><br>Test your skill, embrace the challenge and become the <strong>Eden Warrior</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you’ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the first major boss encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics of Eden-powered combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a glimpse into the mysterious story of a puppet created to hunt fallen heroes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game will feature a series of intense boss battles, fully voiced storytelling, and high replay value for action fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978850/extras/0e35e781acc0502692ad47156789bb63.poster.avif?t=1765629740\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978850/extras/0e35e781acc0502692ad47156789bb63.webm?t=1765629740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht